    <briefdescription>
<para>Validation failure error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1ValidationFailedError" kindref="compound">ValidationFailedError</ref> represents an error where data is syntactically correct but fails semantic or rule-based validation.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>ValidationFailedError();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>ValidationFailedError(&quot;Checksum<sp/>validation<sp/>failed&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
